I got my first tattoo at the age of seventeen.

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:27.100
- When I was eighteen years old.

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:29.900
- At eighteen, and it was a design

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.570
that I had made myself when I got to the tattoo shop.

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.420
- And it was a squid-octopus, I picked it off the wall.

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.380
- What made me wanna get that first tattoo?

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:39.230
I walked into a shop, saw it on the wall,

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.477
pointed at it, said, "Hey, I want that."

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:43.930
(laughing)

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:48.490
- So the weirdest tattoo I've ever done on someone was,

00:00:48.490 --> 00:00:52.110
this woman came in and she wanted to get chocolate-covered

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:55.230
strawberries and it was dripping chocolate,

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:56.530
and it was all over her vagina.

